{"5082780":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Desktop Dreampair","steam_appid":5082780,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"dlc":[5328790],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5082780\/extras\/3b111dd5d00985ee448a3e514999ae8e.avif?t=1793141688\" width=780 height=374 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Hi everyone! Dreampair is a customizable desktop companion for character pair lovers.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Create your favorite character pairs right on your desktop!<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Stay productive with our Focus Mode, and don't forget to add it to your wishlist to show your support!<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5082780\/extras\/f1cf4dff5fd1e5279cd9fb10d1b4dd48.avif?t=1793141688\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5082780\/extras_big\/f1cf4dff5fd1e5279cd9fb10d1b4dd48.webp?t=1793141688 width=1560 height=882 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Desktop Interactions<\/strong><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solo &amp; Pair Actions:<\/strong> dance duets, hold hands, play tag, fight, exchange gifts, fly around, and more.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>User Interaction:<\/strong> Pair reacts to your cursor, pick up characters, feed them Food<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pet<\/strong> : A little pet stays with your pair and roams around your screen.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom Dialogue<\/strong>: Create custom conversations, greetings, nicknames, and unique catchphrases.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5082780\/extras\/b27b3cac83c703007e41bd528b6ab06d.avif?t=1793141688\" alt=\"\"width=896 height=605 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5082780\/extras\/9f290c233a54e221cdc8793b234a9bd0.avif?t=1793141688\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5082780\/extras_big\/9f290c233a54e221cdc8793b234a9bd0.webp?t=1793141688 width=1560 height=1179 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Pair Customization<\/strong> <\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of customizations to express your creativity<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >support for up to 30 pairs!<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Support for multiple pair types<\/strong> lovers \/ family \/ friends \/ enemies  <\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5082780\/extras\/1562f46370c38f7e2db781e2e8551681.avif?t=1793141688\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5082780\/extras_big\/1562f46370c38f7e2db781e2e8551681.webp?t=1793141688 width=1560 height=977 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create &amp; Share Custom Parts<\/strong><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add and use your own custom parts.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Export and share your profile files and custom parts with other users. <br><strong> <\/strong> <\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5082780\/extras\/5080746e2dcd8d5cbd631ee6958eca78.poster.avif?t=1793141688\" width=616 height=402 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5082780\/extras\/5080746e2dcd8d5cbd631ee6958eca78.webm?t=1793141688\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5082780\/extras\/5080746e2dcd8d5cbd631ee6958eca78.mp4?t=1793141688\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bubble Talk (Custom Dialogues)<\/strong><br>Create your own conversations for your characters.<br>characters will talk to each other automatically!<br>Schedule specific lines to appear at set times and days of the week.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5082780\/extras\/e8975aab1ea911fd1a7daaca5cac33e1.avif?t=1793141688\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5082780\/extras_big\/e8975aab1ea911fd1a7daaca5cac33e1.webp?t=1793141688 width=1560 height=1026 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Focus Mode<\/strong><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Focus Timer<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To-do Checklist<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Water Tracker<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pair Connect<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Connect with friends via Steam and Share reactions<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...and many more features to come!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No AI was used for any of the art. All visual assets are 100% human-made.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >_______<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >UI Sound Effects by lolurio<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music: &quot;blossom&quot;, &quot;regrowth wip&quot;, &quot;town&quot; by chajamakesmusic<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Licensed under CC BY 4.0 <\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5082780\/extras\/3b111dd5d00985ee448a3e514999ae8e.avif?t=1793141688\" width=780 height=374 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Hi everyone! Dreampair is a customizable desktop companion for character pair lovers.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Create your favorite character pairs right on your desktop!<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Stay productive with our Focus Mode, and don't forget to add it to your wishlist to show your support!<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5082780\/extras\/f1cf4dff5fd1e5279cd9fb10d1b4dd48.avif?t=1793141688\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5082780\/extras_big\/f1cf4dff5fd1e5279cd9fb10d1b4dd48.webp?t=1793141688 width=1560 height=882 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Desktop Interactions<\/strong><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solo &amp; Pair Actions:<\/strong> dance duets, hold hands, play tag, fight, exchange gifts, fly around, and more.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>User Interaction:<\/strong> Pair reacts to your cursor, pick up characters, feed them Food<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pet<\/strong> : A little pet stays with your pair and roams around your screen.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom Dialogue<\/strong>: Create custom conversations, greetings, nicknames, and unique catchphrases.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5082780\/extras\/b27b3cac83c703007e41bd528b6ab06d.avif?t=1793141688\" alt=\"\"width=896 height=605 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5082780\/extras\/9f290c233a54e221cdc8793b234a9bd0.avif?t=1793141688\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5082780\/extras_big\/9f290c233a54e221cdc8793b234a9bd0.webp?t=1793141688 width=1560 height=1179 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Pair Customization<\/strong> <\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of customizations to express your creativity<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >support for up to 30 pairs!<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Support for multiple pair types<\/strong> lovers \/ family \/ friends \/ enemies  <\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5082780\/extras\/1562f46370c38f7e2db781e2e8551681.avif?t=1793141688\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5082780\/extras_big\/1562f46370c38f7e2db781e2e8551681.webp?t=1793141688 width=1560 height=977 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create &amp; Share Custom Parts<\/strong><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add and use your own custom parts.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Export and share your profile files and custom parts with other users. <br><strong> <\/strong> <\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5082780\/extras\/5080746e2dcd8d5cbd631ee6958eca78.poster.avif?t=1793141688\" width=616 height=402 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5082780\/extras\/5080746e2dcd8d5cbd631ee6958eca78.webm?t=1793141688\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5082780\/extras\/5080746e2dcd8d5cbd631ee6958eca78.mp4?t=1793141688\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bubble Talk (Custom Dialogues)<\/strong><br>Create your own conversations for your characters.<br>characters will talk to each other automatically!<br>Schedule specific lines to appear at set times and days of the week.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5082780\/extras\/e8975aab1ea911fd1a7daaca5cac33e1.avif?t=1793141688\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5082780\/extras_big\/e8975aab1ea911fd1a7daaca5cac33e1.webp?t=1793141688 width=1560 height=1026 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Focus Mode<\/strong><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Focus Timer<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To-do Checklist<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Water Tracker<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pair Connect<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Connect with friends via Steam and Share reactions<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...and many more features to come!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No AI was used for any of the art. All visual assets are 100% human-made.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >_______<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >UI Sound Effects by lolurio<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music: &quot;blossom&quot;, &quot;regrowth wip&quot;, &quot;town&quot; by chajamakesmusic<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Licensed under CC BY 4.0 <\/p>","short_description":"Customize your own character pair and put them on your desktop! Custom parts supported! Watch them talk and hang out on your screen, and share your creations with friends! Focus together in Focus Mode! Your pair sits beside you with a focus timer and a to-do list.","supported_languages":"English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Simplified Chinese, Russian, Spanish - Latin America, Traditional Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5082780\/7f383e3a9544543785850882b133b4f0aecdc189\/header.jpg?t=1793141688","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5082780\/7339fc89aefc9d7d5d2a594b3232d6ca1da860c3\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793141688","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5082780\/7339fc89aefc9d7d5d2a594b3232d6ca1da860c3\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793141688","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i3 \/ AMD Ryzen 3 or equivalent (x64 architecture)<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> DirectX 11 compatible graphics (OpenGL 3.0 or higher, integrated graphics OK)<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Network:<\/strong> Broadband Internet connection<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 1 GB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Additional Notes:<\/strong> This is a transparent, always-on-top desktop pet app. If the screen turns black or blurry, turn on &quot;Compatibility mode (turn off graphics acceleration)&quot; in the settings.<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires an Apple processor<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> macOS 12 Monterey or later<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Apple Silicon <br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Apple Silicon<br><\/li><li><strong>Network:<\/strong> Broadband Internet connection<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 1 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires an Apple processor<\/li><\/ul>"},"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>"}}}}